---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContinueReading from '../components/ContinueReading';
import { getGameBySlug } from '../lib/content';
const seasons = getGameBySlug('seasons');
---
<BaseLayout active="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="kicker">Archive / Memory / Lake</div>
      <h1>进入<br />锈湖档案</h1>
      <p>不是攻略站，而是一套按作品、时间、人物与线索重新组织的剧情阅读器。第一套完整阅读样例是 <strong>Cube Escape: Seasons</strong>：五章原创剧情摘要、实体档案、时间线与防剧透进度已经连通。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button" href="/read/seasons/spring-1964">从 Spring 1964 开始</a>
        <a class="button-ghost" href="/progress">设置游玩进度</a>
      </div>
      <ContinueReading client:load />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-file">
      <article class="file-card">
        <div class="kicker">Case File 01</div>
        <div class="stamp">OPEN</div>
        <h2>{seasons?.title.zhHans ?? 'Cube Escape: Seasons'}</h2>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <div class="file-meta">
          <div><div class="muted">STATUS</div><b>STORY READY</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">MEMORIES</div><b>1964 → 1981</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">LANGUAGE</div><b>中文 / EN / 对照</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">SPOILER</div><b>CONTROLLED</b></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-grid" aria-label="探索入口">
    <a class="home-tile" href="/games"><div class="kicker">01</div><b>按游戏阅读</b><span>Seasons 已完成五章剧情摘要；后续作品继续沿同一 Schema 扩展。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/timeline"><div class="kicker">02</div><b>故事时间线</b><span>按照故事年份而不是发布时间重新组织事件，并保留时间确定性。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/characters"><div class="kicker">03</div><b>人物档案</b><span>阅读过程中点击实体词即可展开档案，并区分事实、解释与理论。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/progress"><div class="kicker">04</div><b>防剧透进度</b><span>进度、语言和主动解锁记录都只保存在当前浏览器。</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
